{"id":1143,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><div><p>2025年4月8日，中煤平朔集团一行来到我院，就招聘事宜与体育学院院长吴剑、党委副书记贾鹏开展座谈，并召开了招聘宣讲会。</p><p>座谈会上，吴院长对中煤平朔集团一行的到来表示欢迎，介绍了学院专业设置、人才培养及毕业生就业情况，希望双方深化合作，为毕业生拓展优质就业平台。中煤平朔集团负责人详细介绍了企业发展概况、岗位需求及人才引进政策，充分肯定我院学生的综合素质，期待吸纳更多优秀学子加入。贾书记就校企协同育人、实习实践基地建设等提出建议，双方达成进一步合作意向。</p><p>4月8日下午，宣讲会在11207H教室举行，招聘单位通过企业宣传片、岗位推介、互动答疑等形式，向学生展示企业文化、职业发展路径及招聘流程，现场气氛热烈，多名学生投递简历并参与初步面试。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/UlWKRUzUanRGZnORWRUlQ7n7-YL4QxfLmCaM8lZozTkMRv0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyaLYyDM1yaLmv4Mln7MmAVMlCZMlUsLzAVMmWRnl7PolrFn7CYUN-DL4AFLzLsL49Jqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUbg474MR7bgtA8pUJcc&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=13419&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C036602735DD68E5F85D718E62CEA19E/DF2BB638/13738\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/o7VK7Mll8olV2nOz67Ul-DozGbol-xZLzQkLRN8Lm6VU4v0gihFp2hmCIa0okyin1h2MYyPLzCiLmWRollDnl7DLzARo7lsM4NioRCbLlrFLzCDMRV2oRWFL4U4ozQkgtXaQ4Oeo4x8_5AbgDTJQty0LzG8oSyPL4UPoSbw62J8c&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=13419&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/M7-KDoRnVM4AkLONCPU8QVLmV2LRCxZL4-iU4vDMzM2o770gihFp2hmCIa0LYhfMYhfM1hVLR7DnmvYnR9PLzU4nRGboRWRo7rfMR7PnRAFnlVfL4NDMNrFLzLiM4NJqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUbg474MR7bgtA8pUJcc&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=13419&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/3A7A6E016F72D81143D0982C8EA411D8/EAA3966E/13579\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/MmNKbM47sLzAkMOR6fUzrRU4Q7LzCxbnmnknlCbolQ7nRL0gihFp2hmCIa0LSy8MYyYM1hkoz6VU4CbnmUsMR9ZozVRnlLbnzlao7VVoRnFMR9ZUzTfUzQFL4-ZUm74gtXaQ4Oeo4x8_5AbgDTJQty0LzG8oSyPL4UPoSbw62J8c&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=13419&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/nlLKYLzC8M8-8MONlboR6RMzTfoR6xRLmC8olUZLzf2oz70gihFp2hmCIa0USh2LkhVL1yZUzVRnNlbUmVVMlCsMR-4LmTfolL4oRC4M46FU8rVMmNZLmfFLzW7MNlJqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUbg474MR7bgtA8pUJcc&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=13419&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/AF0E28A1CFE9B1E5F742329A9C386377/CEE69820/12D6E\" vheight=\"\"